&_nc_oc=Ado9WK_e1MIsCA-NMdW--J0smYS2aZRncuNbJmaVms51pl2xw6zmuVCsMpYvgqjiVYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5l0CI-D2aIKaivvtSPiL--PTHyWYiSRuTKf4G9J3vPEQ&oe=6A1C50BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GLzA0xfCuqgQ7kNvwEfOUeN&_nc_oc=AdqTrOL7pRKLcuphqr58LaUXfaMpBhokpMoxG3GrQuIliXsJ_tBlDJaVbBcXHG41rGo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6aPHCF2F8ugFMPZgWzMTQzp4nUI55NPRyMuZQv5d6kNg&oe=6A1C297C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vawKn5PiemcQ7kNvwExE5jB&_nc_oc=AdqWTx5vbHIxOwpIWQjpJ3PmO9EDo6rwaZq1mHKvXFJtm3_vevjeGr4OJUH7hu9aR0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4n6Cj42S8pxyJ8gdy10qOg-kBIPSKDh7vm7UYwsQSCPA&oe=6A1C4807"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gYjz2e80C4MQ7kNvwGYLa3T&_nc_oc=AdqTAnJ2AYEV6UxkVcyOQTOdYnuQQZI8aGoqTuWaJ5t1OGGlrhEAJLrKncfdZFOsorY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jABoewuTR9AV_hIg5Yn8cxtokOwJpsuaJYPuW2IDrgA&oe=6A1C33D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X1eWGP-I19sQ7kNvwE87afq&_nc_oc=AdqSgSaxvM8csWwiqRgqWl8KHHMiqvbiqlbBR7ASR2mCfJ0TBBU1o9wJJh4eTn61J6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5IdEXo7H45TDEPV58F_XHBhfWQoR1Yu3G1JyF5xURnxg&oe=6A1C4064"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.